</span><span><span><span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>085406</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>电子信息（控制工程）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>00(</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>S0863</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>机器人技术</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>01(</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>机器人结构与制造</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>02(</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>机器人控制与算法</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>085510</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>机器人工程</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>00(</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>)不区分研究方向(</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>工程硕博士专项</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span><span><span>二、接收条件</span></span></span></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>．拥护党的领导，愿为国家建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>．学习成绩优秀，综合成绩名列前茅。</span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>优先接收来自</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>双一流</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>建设高校</span></span><span><span>的优秀应届本科毕业生。优先接收在校期间参加课外学术科研、学科竞赛等取得优异成绩的应届本科毕业生。优先接收来自机器人工程、自动化、导航工程、机械工程及其自动化、机械电子工程、智能制造工程、电气工程及其自动化和电子信息工程等相关专业的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>鼓励相关</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>双一流</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>建设高校数学、物理、计算机科学与技术、人工智能、遥感信息工程、材料科学与工程、通信工程、交通工程的跨学科优秀应届本科生报名。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>本科期间无任何处分记录。</span></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>三、预报名流程及注意事项</span></span></span></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>．</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日，申请人通过武汉大学预推免报名系统</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>yz.whu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名并提交预推免申请材料。对于首次登录的考生，需要先完成注册，才能登录系统。（非我校校园网用户可登录系统时间为每天早</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>00-</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>晚</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>23</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）。</span></span><b><span><span>申请信息务必真实、准确。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实，取消录取资格并通报学生所在高校。申请人所有纸质申请材料原件请留存，以便核实复查。</span></span></b></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>提交材料如下（请严格按照以下顺序整理）：</span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）《武汉大学机器人学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>推荐免试硕士研究生预报名申请表》（以下简称《申请表》，附件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>），《申请表》上应有本人亲笔签名、所在院系推荐意见和学校教务部门盖章；</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）《武汉大学机器人学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名个人陈述》</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>以下简称《个人陈述》，见附件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，应有本人亲笔签名；</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）《武汉大学机器人学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名选拔考核承诺书》（以下简称《承诺书》，附件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>），应有本人亲笔签名；</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）《武汉大学机器人学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名成果简表》（以下简称《成果简表》，附件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，以</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成果简表</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>姓名</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>命名）。</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）其他材料：</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>①</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>身份证、学生证</span></span></span></span><span><span>复印件（复印在</span></span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span><span><span>纸的同一页面上）；</span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>②</span></span><span><span>前</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>个学期的大学学习成绩单原件，须加盖申请者本人所在单位教务部门的学习成绩专用章，</span></span><span><span><span>A3</span></span></span><span><span>幅面的成绩单请按照</span></span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span><span><span>幅面分页扫描，确保姓名、学号、课程名称及成绩显示清晰；</span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>③</span></span><span><span>申请人所在学院（系）出具的前</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>个学期专业成绩排名以及年级总人数情况证明。如只能提供前</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>学期成绩的，由本科所在学院（系</span></span><span><span><span><span>）出具说明并盖章。</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>④</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>英语水平证明：国家英语四、六级考试成绩或</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/IELTS</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩单等；</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>⑤</span></span></span></span><span><span>体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、专利、出版物或原创性成果，其他各类证书（期刊论文须附上封面、目录和文章全文，出版物著作等须附上封面、目录</span></span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>⑥</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>各类获奖证书等。</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>材料提交要求：附件</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>、附件</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>、附件</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>、附件</span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>其他材料</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>（注意：</span></span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>、附件</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>、附件</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>、附件</span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span>以</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>报名号</span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span>申报专业</span></span><span><span><span>-‘</span></span></span><span><span>附件简称</span></span><span><span><span>’-</span></span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>命名；</span></span><span><span><span>2.“</span></span></span><span><span>其他材料</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>扫描时纸张需摆放端正，统一方向，扫描文字、图片需清晰，整理为</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>个</span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span>彩色文件，以</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>报名号</span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span>申报专业</span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span>就读学校名称</span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span><span>.PDF”</span></span></span><span><span>命名）。</span></span><span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>．材料提交截止时间为</span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>24:00</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>．材料审核工作由学院组织专门工作小组负责。工作小组将根据学生提交的申请材料，对照相关申请条件，对申请人</span></span></span><span><span>进行初审。通过初审的申请人将在系统内收到预推免考核通知。收到通知并确认的学生需实名加入</span></span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span><span><span>群（群号另行通知），并修改群名片为</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>学校</span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span>申请专业</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>（如：武汉大学</span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span>张</span></span><span><span><span>三</span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span><span>机器人技术）。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>四、考核并发放</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>待录取资格</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>．考核时间定于</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span><span><span><span>日。具体时间、地点和形式通</span></span></span><span><span>过</span></span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span><span><span>群</span></span><span><span><span>通知。原则上武汉市内考生须线下参加考核，武汉市外考生可选择线上考核。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>．报名“</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>085510</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>机器人工程”专业工程硕博士专项直博生的考核由学校相关单位单独组织，考核时间、方式、地点另行通知。</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考核分三个部分进行，即：背景评估、英语面试及综合面试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）背景评估：根据申请人提交的申请材料进行评估，包括：考生的教育背景，学习成绩及排名等情况。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>英语面试：测试考生英语听说读写及应用能力。</span></span><span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>综合面试：综合面试包括心理素质及专业能力测试。主要测试考生的心理素质、掌握本专业系统</span></span><span><span>知识的情况、攻读硕士学位的目的与科研计划等。重在考查学生的学术基础、运用所学知识</span></span><span><span>的能力、科研创新能力（专业能力倾向）以及对本学科前沿领域及最新研究动态的掌握情况等。</span></span><span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>．考生请按照个人基本情况（政治思想情况、学生和社团工作、学习成绩、个人兴趣爱好等）、课外学术科研及竞赛成果、未来研究计划三部分结构</span></span><b><span><span>准备</span></span></b></span><b><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>分钟的个人陈述</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>PPT</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>，并于考核前按</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>群内要求提交。学院将严格执行“不区分导师”录取制度，考生陈述过程中不得提及学院研究生导师姓名等有关信息。</span></span></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>．考核综合成绩计算：考核综合成绩、背景评估成绩、英语面试及综合面试成绩均为百分制。考核综合成绩＝背景评估</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>×30%</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>＋英语面试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>×20%+</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>综合面试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>×50%</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span><span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>预推免考核综合成绩将作为考生正式推免的复试综合成绩使用。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6. </span></span></span></span><span><span><span>考核综合成绩排名在各专业接收计划数内的申请人将获得</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>待录取资格</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>，并按照各专业接收计划数的一定比例依次往后确定候补人员名单，在系统内通知。待教育部</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>开通后，获得</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>待录取资格</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>的申请人</span></span><span><span>必须在</span></span><span><span>该教育部系统</span></span><span><span>中完</span></span><span><span>成正式志愿填报等相关操作，学院将优先录取。如有空余计划，在同意调剂前提下，候补人员依次递补录取。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>五、其他事项</span></span></span></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>．申请人申请过程中若存在任何弄虚作假，一经发现将取消其研究生录取资格，后果由申请人本人负责。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>．我院将进行线上宣传宣讲等活动，宣传活动时间、方式</span></span></span><span><span>将在</span></span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span><span><span>群内</span></span><span><span><span>公布。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>．我院将根据教育部和武汉大学最新推免生政策，及时公布</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>接收推免生的各项工作通知。推</span></span><span><span>免生的正式报</span></span><span><span>名和录取工作按照《</span></span></span><span><span>机器人学院</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试硕士研究生工作实施细则</span></span><span><span>》和《武汉大学</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生公告》执行。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联</span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span>系</span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span>人：王老师</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span><span><span><span><span>联系邮件：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>whsnowgirl@whu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>备注：附件可点击“阅读原文”跳转下载，或进入“武汉大学机器人学院”官网下载。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>武汉大学机器人学院</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"09410cf2dacba1252df079650bc3f2c4752ebc198302116f834c9dd13b189361","textLength":3059,"sourceSha256":"8fcb7c905830748ccfdbe61cf6527a249dec8c73c7237c324863e129da5c8278","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-eb2aac6a4ae5b95e5d3f","title":"2025年武汉大学机器人学院2026年接收推荐免试硕士研究生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:45.771279+00:00"}
